        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 699DA, Dakota Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity with flair, the clean lines of the Dakota Handleset lend a casual ambiance to your entry door. The Dakota 699DA Dummy Cylinder is made by Kwikset who has been a leader in the residential door hardware for more than 60 years. Dummy Handlesets do not function and are usually used as pulls to match trim on the inactive side of double doors. This two piece oval mount entryset make it great for traditional decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> is for looks only. It does not lock and do not latch. Dummy handlesets are used as pulls or to match trim on double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src =\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Dummy_Cylinder_Handleset.jpg?v=1704352980\" width=\"226\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Dummy Cylinder Function Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/dakota-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-687da\"><b>Single Cylinder Dakota Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dakota 699DA Two Piece Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sold as a complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Oval Dakota Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Crossbore: 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Crossbore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dakota Dummy Handleset, KWI-699DA",
                "description": "Kwikset 699DA Dakota Dummy Cylinder Handleset - Security with flair, the clean lines of the Dakota Handleset lend a casual ambiance to your entry door. The Dakota 699DA Dummy Cylinder has a Lifetime warranty on the finish. This handleset is made by Kwikset who has been a leader in the residential door hardware for more than 60 years. Dummy Handlesets do not function and are usually used as pulls to match trim on the inactive side of double doors. This two piece oval mount entryset make it great for traditional decor.",
